Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we're away from\Nthe Boom Boom family,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the damage they did to us\Nis healing up pretty quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we should celebrate\Nour good fortune yet, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of a trick was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The dirty kind, clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe more of a curse if\Nyou want to get particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If they manage to touch you, their\Niron attacks are no laughing matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all the worse\Nonce you're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Their curse attracts the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're like magnets,\Npulling and repelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's late, but we have to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If they catch up, we might\Nnot get lucky a second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tyro, someone's back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Another boom-boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No way in hell am I letting that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Those three racers were killed\Nby Johnny Joestar, of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The bodies, they were savaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.72,0:01:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure he faces\Njustice, dead or alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Speedin', speedin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.52,0:03:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all we should do. We'll\Nbe wanting to get the best job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's not slowing down at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything, he's gaining on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.74,0:03:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our horses must be\Nexhausted, so how's he doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Something feels off about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he really a member\Nof the Boom Boom family?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see it too well, but I feel like\NI've seen that weird hat somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever he is, he's closing in faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already reached\Nthe top of the plateau!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Melt and Tim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So why the hell's he running\Nus down in the dead of night?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:04:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll all be within magnetic\Nrange of each other soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they reach that point, they'll get\Npulled into a meaty pile of pain and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when they split open\Nand their guts fall out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at full gallop and he's\Ncatching up on us like it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation is so much\Nworse than we suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mountain Tim is speeding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's more to it than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is getting pulled backward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fight it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:04:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Like clockwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pulled him right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't have planned it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Course Mountain Tim wouldn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And once they get close enough, the\Nmagnetism will crush the life out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Daddy, let's watch up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be there where\Ntheir guts burst out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'll get lucky and they'll fly\Nthrough the air like a ticker tape parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just, I'm feeling\Npretty chilly over here, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And my vision keeps getting blurrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to complain, but I\Nmight be in some real trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus, Andrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you focus on what's\Nimportant for a change?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck it up till we get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned into a magnet without even\Nrealizing the change had taken place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of the boom-booms\Ngot his hands on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have touched you at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the first idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the bullet's to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The final round Benny Boom Boom shot at\Nme, maybe it flung a little blood my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have to lure them out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't have gone far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.92,0:06:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be controlling the\Nmagnetism from somewhere nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think they're actively\Nmaking this happen to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mountain Tim's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's definitely been on\Nour trail for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And all of this started up\Nagain when he got close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being dragged\Nbackwards the way we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:06:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And so are you, Gyro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to Tim is the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At some point, the boo-boos must\Nhave touched him, same as us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we knew it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,they fixed all three of us to crash\Ninto each other if we get close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The pole was too weak to\Nnotice when it was just us two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But with Mounted Tim in the mix,\Nthe attraction is growing stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When we all finally collide, the\Nmagnetism is going to destroy us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We're hurling straight at him\Nwhile he rushes up on horseback!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't he fall off\Nhis damn horse, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't noticed yet because he's\Nheading toward us of his own volition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.32,0:07:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens when the\Nthree of us come together?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The iron in my blood is\Nbursting out of my body, Gyro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let him get any closer to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.98,0:07:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't turn back, all three of us\Nwill probably explode from the strain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:07:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get him off of his horse, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's Johnny Joestar laying on the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And Gyro Zeppeli's with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.56,0:08:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he shouting\Nabout? Stop, please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,come any closer damn it\Nhe can't hear a word i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,saying he's gonna hit\Nus even if mountain tim
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,could hear you i doubt\Nhe'd hop off his horse just
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,because you told him\Nso if we don't tell him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.86,0:08:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we've all been magnetized\Nwe're each gonna pop one
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,by one rather not in that\Ncase let's drag him out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the saddle. There's no\Nway it's gonna reach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,gyro it's impossible your\Nwhole body is magnetized
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.86,0:08:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,remember the steel ball will just fly back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,that's kind of the idea\Nit's gonna curve back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.42,0:08:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,after i throw it like a\Nboomerang it's not a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,johnny it's the whole\Ndamn reason i threw it in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the first place i'd wager\Nthat's more than enough
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,to drag him off his horse a fair amount of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:09:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,debris that it's gonna\Nhurt like a son of a bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For us as much as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.39,0:09:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All three of us are\Nmagnets until we ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.26,0:09:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All of that falling rock's full of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes, Johnny! Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.36,0:09:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It did the trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,With him off his warts, we've got\Ntime to figure this thing out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm being\Npulled by something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is my gun sticking to my arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble, Gyro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mounted Tim's too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The magnetism is stronger\Nthan gravity now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna crash into us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My blood vessels are bursting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Lasso Blues!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:09:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell'd he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I throw up my lariat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can split my body into pieces\Nand travel the length of the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,As near as I can figure it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,bringing this parley too close\Nis gonna end bad for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't they dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Those bastards are gonna get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to cut that son's a bitchin' rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I had the wrong jockey\Npecked for a killer, Johnny Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.94,0:10:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This magnetic force that's\Npulling on every inch of me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,even now whose ability is this\Ntell me everything you can
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Down to the last little detail
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get it the boom boom\Nfamily are the culprits
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems they can manipulate iron and\Nif I'd gotten too close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That would have been the\Nend of us Let me move up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty damn calm about\Nthis first the boom boom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:11:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,idiots and now your rope\Ntrick Are you human or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.40,0:11:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me damn it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I figure I could ask the same of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your balls are a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.38,0:11:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty to learn if you know where to look
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds about right folks do\Ncontain multitudes. That is true
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep mine simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It was 15 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Back in 1875, I was 16 at the\Ntime, serving in the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was part of a mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,sent here to explore an unmapped\Nstretch of the Arizona desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But my cavalry unit got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We wandered for days in search\Nof a watering hole, all in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We passed into an area feared by the native\Npeople who called it the Devil's Palm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It certainly lived up to its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,compasses couldn't find\Nnorth the needle just
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,spun the ground would\Nbetray you like quicksand
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.04,0:12:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,what's worse the very\Nlandscape shifted around
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,us with mountains and\Nvalleys appearing and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,disappearing at will\Nlooking back we never stood
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.82,0:12:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A chance. It's said that\Nthe devil's palm can shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,by several miles in a\Nsingle day no one knows
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,its actual dimensions or\Nwhere it should lie on a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Native legends say a shooting\Nstar destroyed this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,of the desert long ago\Ncursing the area for all time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We never did find a watering hole
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But on the brink of death\NI had a brush with destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow I woke from my torpor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.24,0:12:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the hour was late
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:13:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,at night a tiny amount of\Ndew would form on my rope
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and my body was absorbing\Nthe moisture even as I slept
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to this commingling\Nof rope and flesh
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I would prove the lone survivor
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if the\Ngravity there is to blame,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but they say the Devil's\NPawn draws out latent
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,abilities that lie\Ndormant within a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The indigenous people call\Nthem cursed abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe they're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, the natural thing would have\Nbeen for me to die along with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.02,0:13:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That which stands against,\Nthat's what I call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This ability that saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stand, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Or that which stands against?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Boom Boom family also unlocks some\Nsleeping power within the Devil's Palm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,in other words, if we\Nwant to continue the race,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:14:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll need to track the bastards down and\Ndefeat them to cancel out the magnetism?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to go to all that trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to find us, and\NI wouldn't worry about the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your only move left is\Ncloser to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.38,0:14:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you said before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can do it by your lonesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can cut that rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mountain Tim's rope, I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy my lonesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I can and maybe I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He wrapped us up in iron sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pulling tiny particles\Nfrom the ground and shaping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sticking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Tim, look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's headed straight for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe your dear old Danny lets you\Nbite off more than you can chew, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of trouble they get\Nafter if you don't pin down their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Daddy, you're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.56,0:15:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You take such good care of me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that, Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the right decent sentiment\Nto convey to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you finish him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and cut Mountain\NTim's rope right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that thing cut his rope in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where it's going is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, that's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no use, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.68,0:15:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Struggle all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but your guts are gonna litter the\Nlandscape here in pretty short order!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnny, you've still got\Na hand free! So do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, we're all dead, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now or never, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to use spin and\Nkill the two of them first!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a bullet on the ground over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:15:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullets are made of lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.32,0:16:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not affected by the magnetic\Nfield, meaning you can fire it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to live, you need\Nto spin that goddamn bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.51,0:16:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnny, you don't have a choice.\NIt's lesson number three. I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,know you made that corkspin you\Ntold me about it yourself yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I did but it was just a look\Nbelieve in the spin Johnny there's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,no end to what you can do with\Nit and believe in yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.20,0:16:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so late! He's falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.58,0:16:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They fused, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how far they're going to fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one do you think is\Ngoing to shoot at them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tearing apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Spin the bullet, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's do or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't we done it once before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I even pull it off again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is what I joined the race to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,To learn the secret of the spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.54,0:16:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And in time, to make that power my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bodies are gonna rip apart any second!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if you don't, this is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's spinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it spin, Gyro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lawrence, you gotta keep an eye out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You never know what someone on\Nthe brink of death is gonna try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good, Chiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I took too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't figure it out fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, I gotta tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.73,0:17:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's too late\Nto keep an eye out. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to get away\Nbefore he murders you dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.98,0:17:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hans ain't supposed to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What a donation, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:17:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell are you doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My fingernails!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing, Gyro? Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Steel Ball Spin's never\Ndone anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.14,0:18:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, could this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.10,0:18:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get over here\Non the double daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you still got a leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.98,0:18:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell my nails to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, wish I could tell you, but\NI'm just as shocked as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.84,0:18:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut my daddy in half, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tear all your\Nveins open, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My paralyzed legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They leapt into the air like it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.11,0:19:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm freaking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crazy fingernails have nothing to\Ndo with the steel ball spin technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on your own, amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If Gyro's ability isn't affecting\Nyour current predicament,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,no doubt about it, you have a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A sleeping power of yours has\Nbeen awakened, Johnny Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to the Devil's Pink.\NWe must have wandered into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,always moving like it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You being here brought\Nthat ability to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I have a stand\Nthat was in me all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You ending up here could be coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.24,0:19:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe the land lassoed\Nyou and hauled you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I reckon it was the latter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Call your horses on the double.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go before the\Nterrain changes on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't leave soon,\Nwe'll never find our way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.90,0:20:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What the... Valkyrie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you daddy-killing bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.66,0:20:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you\Nfor making me an orphan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll avenge my brother's pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When my big brother\Ngets here, you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.62,0:20:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother Andrew, beat\Nthese guys to a pulp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrew, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've been killed too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.70,0:20:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the last one be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bite your tongue, gyrocephaly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.86,0:20:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you're making it to the\Nend of this race, you're a damn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly believe we boom-booms are\Nthe only ones trying to send you to hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know how much of a\Nprice you've got on your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:21:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,$200,000 payable to whosoever can\Nsend your ass to kingdom come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your taser number, gyrocephaly,\Nyou're a wanted man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So who put you inbreds up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.64,0:21:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep Darkling and we'll\Nall be stuck here forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother Andrew!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The power that I manifested,\Nwhat brought that to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, who is Gyrocephaly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.60,0:21:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who put a bounty on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hiding something, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,baka shite tara naku naru\Nkachime Zibun no aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.90,0:22:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nish kara hikashi e Keo to so to suru\Nhito ha ki ni shi nai de Tai sen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.52,0:22:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,aite ga zibun Noriaki chige Ma\Nwari to mi kura be wa shi nai,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.78,0:22:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,ho ka to ha chige Darre mo i te nai michi\Nsa ga shideru tabi e Darre ga naru ijiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stir, por, la, stir, por, la,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.66,0:23:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.66,0:24:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.30,0:25:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
